; Duke Dungeon — a map drawn once: a dungeon that has stopped changing.
;
; The end (docs/plan/2026-10-09-final-fight.md): the queen's hall. The heroine comes
; in through the antechamber; at the hall's door the queen is shown on her throne
; and speaks; she calls the cursed hero to her side, and fights from afar behind
; him. He cannot be killed, only beaten -- spared, he kneels -- and then she fights
; herself. Her death breaks the medallion: the souls rise, and the run is won.

